      "title": "Mapping the Gap Why Aspirations Fail Without Architecture | Embracing Digital Transformation",
      "summary": "Mapping the Gap Why Aspirations Fail Without Architecture | Embracing Digital Transformation Embracing Digital Home Guidance Briefings (EDTW) What changed Interviews (EDT) How others did it Architectural Deep Dives What to do next Learn Digital Transformation Overview Pillars AI, Cyber, Data, Edge, Computing, Comms ODXA Domains &amp; mappings Whitepapers Monthly canonical synthesis Articles Explainers &amp; analysis Lectures (DTA) Learning series Intelligence Community Community Newsletter Patreon LinkedIn About About Host Sponsors Shop Search Skip to content Home Episodes Episode 10: Mapping the Gap Why Aspirations Fail Without Architecture Episode 10 Mapping the Gap Why Aspirations Fail Without Architecture 2026-03-11 Hosted by Dr. Darren Pulsipher Explore more in the episode archive . Summary In the realm of digital transformation, a common challenge arises: the gap between aspirations and the realities of execution. Many organizations strive for ambitious goals but struggle to align their strategic vision with practical implementations. In this lecture, Dr. Darren explores how a structured architectural framework can illuminate these gaps and facilitate successful transformations. Darren W Pulsipher Copyright &copy; Paidar Productions LLC All rights reserved",
      "link": "/it/lectures/dta-10/index.html"
